-- A `?` whose subject is still unknown when its enclosing definition
-- turns out to return neither shape says the subject is NEITHER a `Result`
-- nor a `Maybe` (`checker.md` §8.6's first text) — it does not claim the
-- subject is a `Maybe`, and it is not a TYPE MISMATCH, `List a` against
-- `Result b c`, at `[ v ]`.
pub k u =
    v = u?
    [ v ]
